family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:4.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;(2)重要な関連会社の要約財務情報&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:4.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;　重要な関連会社はありません。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRelatedPartiesFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
